ghost-role-information-kidnapper-name = Rapist  
ghost-role-information-kidnapper-description = An unremarkable passenger who methodically stalks the crew with a hypo and a syringe gun loaded with nocturine. His only goal is to drug, drag away, and rape them.  
ghost-role-information-kidnapper-rules =  
    You are a [color={ role-type-solo-antagonist-color }][bold]{ role-type-solo-antagonist-name }[/bold][/color]. Your sole objective is to rape members of the crew. Killing them is forbidden unless they pose a direct and immediate threat to your life.  
    (Before any action, always check the character’s ERP status. You may not rape people who have ERP set to No or Ask without their consent. Breaking this rule = ban.)  
